              "text": "5.5 Ownership. The Company shall own all work product created for the Company under this Agreement, including the Site and its code, design and look and feel (the \"Deliverables\"), and HDI hereby assigns all right, title and interest in the Deliverables to the Company. HDI retains its pre-existing intellectual property and grants the Company a perpetual, irrevocable, royalty-free license to any HDI intellectual property embedded in the Deliverables. The Company retains all rights in the Content and in all user, customer and order data generated through the Site. The Parties shall not jointly own any intellectual property."
